{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112191","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112191/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112191/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112191/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112191","id":3570069127,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wlTwL","number":112191,"title":"Implement point size emulation in the forward shader for D3D12.","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-30T10:32:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T09:15:39Z","closed_at":"2025-12-02T18:00:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112191","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112191.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112191.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-02T18:00:31Z"},"body":"# Introduction\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a point size emulation path in the higher level rendering code to handle D3D12 not supporting it natively.\r\n\r\n## Implementation Details\r\n\r\nInstead of using the point primitive type, two triangles forming a quad are rendered instead. To correctly pass per-point data to each quad, all elements in the mesh's vertex array are modified to have per-instance frequency. The quad itself is procedurally generated in the vertex shader using the vertex index.\r\n\r\nEssentially, the draw call changes from:\r\n- Vertex count: Point count\r\n- Instance count: Instance count\r\n\r\nTo:\r\n- Vertex count: Instance count x 6\r\n- Instance count: Point count\r\n\r\nThis also means any shader code that uses vertex or instance indices needs to be adjusted accordingly. This is handled using specialized macros, which change to the following definitions when point size emulation is enabled:\r\n- Vertex index: Instance index\r\n- Instance index: Vertex index / 6\r\n\r\n## Caveats\r\n\r\n* Index buffers cannot be used without passing every single vertex buffer as input uniforms to the shader. I'm avoiding this approach because using index buffers with point primitives doesn't make much sense anyway.\r\n* Indirect calls cannot be supported due to the modifications made to the draw call arguments. \r\n\r\nThese two issues likely could be solved with geometry shaders but Godot has no support for them and they are horribly inefficient.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nFrom what I've seen, instance frequency is not used anywhere else in Godot, so I want to make sure the changes I made here make sense:\r\n- The vertex array create function takes a vertex count argument, and draw lists use this value to determine how many vertices to draw, rather than taking it from the draw command. I decided to pass 0 as the count when point size emulation is used, since technically the array only contains instanced data, and the quads themselves are procedurally generated in the vertex shader. The actual number of \"procedurally generated\" vertices is passed to the draw command instead.\r\n- I removed the validation check from the procedural draw path because I'm using instanced vertex data to draw procedural quads, which should be a valid use case.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFixes #106078.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112191/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112191/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"stat